# 复制为 .env 按本机修改(.env 已被 git 忽略,不会提交)
# 所有键都可选;不设置时脚本使用下述注释里的默认布局。

# macOS 原生版游戏目录(install.sh 的默认目标)
#STS2_GAME_DIR="$HOME/Library/Application Support/Steam/steamapps/common/Slay the Spire 2"

# Steam 库根(build.sh 在此下寻找 BaseLib 引用)
#STS2_STEAMAPPS="$HOME/Library/Application Support/Steam/steamapps"

# CrossOver/Wine 瓶内 Windows 版游戏目录(tools/build-windows.sh 构建+安装用)
#STS2_WIN_GAME_DIR="$HOME/Library/Application Support/CrossOver/Bottles/Steam/drive_c/Program Files (x86)/Steam/steamapps/common/Slay the Spire 2"
